<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>The <strong><%= @run.provider.upcase %></strong> FX rate feed could not load every rate for <strong><%= l @run.run_date %></strong>.</p>

<ul>
  <% @run.missing_items.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item["key"].to_s.sub("/", "→") %> — <%= item["reason"] %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<% if @run.error_message.present? %>
  <p>Provider message: <%= @run.error_message %></p>
<% end %>

<p>Until the feed loads them, enter the missing rates by hand under Exchange Rates (they are stored as Manual rates and win over feed rates on the same date).</p>

<p>Thank you,<br><%= @entity.name %> System</p>
